{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1743410004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starseed is an immersive farming sim that blends tranquility and subtle dark undertones in an atmosphere of isolation. Millions of miles from civilization, you find yourself alone on distant worlds, working without the distraction of combat. It\u2019s a peaceful experience about saving our home world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this farm sim there's no relationships to build, your interactions are with your machines, helper drones and with mission control back on Earth. You are millions of miles from the people you're trying to save!   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and discover the many features of different planets. It's your job to harness those features and traits to your advantage. Complete missions and unlock upgrades to match your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Research:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and research the minerals and many features of the planets. Grow crops more efficiently or focus on mining or production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Craft machines and tools to aid you in your research and production. Manage machine networks and send resources back to home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1743410004\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your base to produce a steady output of resources. Fulfill orders. Be self sufficient, machines need power to run!\u00a0Build robots to aid in your work and production.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1743410004\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedural Side Missions:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of unique handcrafted missions and procedural missions with various rewards to help you progress! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playthrough is unique. With each playthrough: The cave systems and mines are different. The random events and side missions will be different. The planets and astronauts are different. Allowing for endless replayability! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1743410004\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bot Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/5a0672655b012254d94936a4196ec8a17c1cf10d.jpg"},{"name":"Furnace Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/145e4c33292c332a6cc8e899f513d03a7839eb74.jpg"},{"name":"Apple Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/c53658e02586a2efc2cb00a38a0c12cf3718d0fe.jpg"},{"name":"Rocks Must Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/ab1d7acd2a5c3934d4551f0027c2dbe293db84af.jpg"},{"name":"Tesla","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/9564a30cebf43838eaae96c5386c21e9ab1ae6ce.jpg"},{"name":"Soiled Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/b90b1f2f302b68ad9dce8b0cc2a78ebfd9309e33.jpg"},{"name":"Spend It All ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/1955ad7d5c4e857de517f219c7664cf744b28ad0.jpg"},{"name":"First Sale","path":"https://cdn.akama